  "description": "Raised as the only beta in a family of dominant alphas, one sibling longs for the affection that always feels just out of reach.\n\nBut beneath years of strained family ties lies an obsessive, forbidden desire, as hidden fixations surface, the illusion of family shatters, exposing a dark struggle of possession, manipulation, and twisted love.\n\n**Original Novel:**  \nVolumes: [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/2336002816), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/aristocratic_e), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/novel/E000105256), [Bookcube](https://www.bookcube.com/detail.asp?series_num=919022415)  \nChapters: [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/aristocratic), [Joara](https://www.joara.com/book/1406723)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/4946000484)\n\n##### NOTE: In the original novel, the three brothers are blood-related. However, in the webtoon adaptation, only the bottom is not blood-related to the two tops.",
